      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.78,
      "end_seconds": 266.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "right, good, you can sit up again okay, thinking it through, the most likely explanation is primary dysmenorrhoea"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.81,
      "end_seconds": 269.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
